  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fmakeship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/slabfish_plush.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/environmental.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"藍圖\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/blueprint\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"網站\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fpatreon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p><h3>📖 關於：</h3><p>Environmental 是一個通用的主世界地表擴展模組，進一步鼓勵探索現有生態域，並完善和改善其視覺效果。引入了新的生態域，如繁花林地、松樹貧瘠地和沼澤地！伴隨這些還有數種新的生物，包括板魚、鹿、斑馬、貘等等！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fabnormals_delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fallurement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fatmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fautumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fberry_good\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fboatload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fbuzzier_bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fcaverns_and_chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fclayworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fendergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fincubation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/incubation.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/lin